This NOTICE lists third-party datasets and voice models that Ruko was trained, evaluated or built with, together with their
authors, licences and licence links. No third-party dataset rows are redistributed in this repository: they are downloaded
at build time by ml/fetch_data.py (SHA-256 pinned in ml/data_pins.json) and are git-ignored. Where we used CC BY 4.0
material we changed it: we removed or replaced personal data (phone numbers, UPI IDs, e-mails, account and card numbers,
URLs) with fixed placeholders, mapped labels to scam / genuine, dropped some rows and split the data into train and test sets.
See ml/DATA_CARD.md for exactly how each source is used.

